=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Wahid (HP #1 {z:Bastok Mines}), he will ask for a "{@i:Siren's Tear|576} {i:Siren's Tear|Siren's Tear|576}".
** **(Optional)** Go to the Steaming Sheep Restaurant at {z:Port Bastok} (E-6) and talk to {n:Otto}, then {n:Carmelo} for hints about the tear.
* Travel to J-9 in {z:North Gustaberg} and look for a **???**. The **???** will appear randomly up and down the length of the river.
** Port Bastok HP #1 to North Gustaberg is the quickest way to get to this river
* Make sure you have 1 free inventory slot in active bag.
* Unequip all weapons and shield in "Main" and "Sub" slot if applicable, then examine the **???** and you will receive the message "... has obtained a Siren's Tear".
** If you don't unequip your weapons, then the tear won't be collected and the ??? will move to a different spot.
* Go back to Wahid, trade {@i:Siren's Tear|576} {i:Siren's Tear|Siren's Tear|576} to complete quest.
* Can be repeated as many times as you want.

